Source: autoware-acados-1-9-0
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Jerry Lin <jerry73204@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake, git, build-essential
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: autoware-acados-1-9-0
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: acados OCP/QP solver runtime for Autoware 1.9.0
 Runtime libraries of the acados optimal control solver (with blasfeo,
 hpipm, and qpOASES), built from the upstream v0.5.3 sources with the
 same configuration as the Autoware 1.9.0 builder image.
 .
 Required at runtime by ros-humble-autoware-path-optimizer-1-9-0 and
 ros-humble-autoware-trajectory-optimizer-1-9-0, whose MPC solvers link
 libacados.so.
 .
 Installed to /opt/autoware/1.9.0 (resolved via the sourced Autoware
 environment's LD_LIBRARY_PATH).
